leigh Ave Suite 300, Middle River, MD 21220\r\n\r\n\r\nCONFIDENTIALITY NOTICE\r\nThe information contained in this electronic message is confidential information intended for the use of the individual or entity named above. If the reader of this message is not the intended recipient, or an employee or agent responsible for delivering this electronic message to the intended recipient, you are hereby notified that any dissemination, or copying of this communication is strictly prohibited. If this message contains non-public personal information about any consumer or customer of the sender or intended recipient, you are further prohibited under penalty of law from using or disclosing the information to any third party by provisions of the federal Gramm-Leach-Bliley Act. If you have received this electronic message in error, please immediately notify us by return email and destroy the original message to assure that it is not read, copied, or distributed by others.\r\n\r\nFrom: Alex Jaffe <AJaffe@firsthome.com<mailto:AJaffe@firsthome.com>>\r\nSent: Friday, May 22, 2026 1:09 PM\r\nTo: First Home VOE <VOE@firsthome.com<mailto:VOE@firsthome.com>>; Michaela O'May <MO'May@firsthome.com>\r\nCc: Zach Fahey <ZFahey@firsthome.com<mailto:ZFahey@firsthome.com>>; John Gruszecki <JGruszecki@firsthome.com<mailto:JGruszecki@firsthome.com>>; Megan Swinehart <MSwinehart@firsthome.com<mailto:MSwinehart@firsthome.com>>\r\nSubject: FW: FW: Verification of Employment Request Jabel Prom [1081510476-10]\r\n\r\nThere is a possibility that we close today, see below and attached.\r\nJabel can get us mybiz on Tuesday and will do so.  Do we have enough to close today?\r\n\r\n[cid:image010.png@01DCE9FE.16A35480]<https://firsthomemortgage.mymortgage-online.com/loan-app/?siteId=1276844701&lar=ajaffe&workFlowId=43656>\r\n\r\nAlex Jaffe\r\nBranch Manager & Senior Loan Officer\r\najaffe@firsthome.com<mailto:ajaffe@firsthome.com>\r\n[FHMC Logo sized]<https://ajaffe.firsthome.com/>[AJ Team Logo sized]<http://www.alexjaffe.com/my-team>\r\nDirect Office (best): 240-479-7658 | Cell: 301-928-8030 | Patrick Tarectecan (teammate) Direct Office: 240-479-7659\r\n8401 Connecticut Ave Ste 1100 Chevy Chase MD 20815\r\nSchedule an appointment: calendly.com/alexjaffe/30min\r\nSite: firsthome.com<http://firsthome.com/loan-officers/alex-jaffe/>   | Blog: alexjaffe.com<http://www.alexjaffe.com/>   |   Youtube Channel<http://www.youtube.com/mortgagevid>\r\nClients: Click here for the link to upload or e-sign documents<https://firsthomemortgage.mymortgage-online.com/?borrowerportal&siteid=1276844701>\r\nNMLS ID 192106<https://nmlsconsumeraccess.org/EntityDetails.aspx/INDIVIDUAL/192106>\r\nCONFIDENTIALITY NOTICE\r\nThe information contained in this electronic message is confidential information intended for the use of the individual or entity named above. If the reader of this message is not the intended recipient, or an employee or agent responsible for delivering this electronic message to the intended recipient, you are hereby notified that any dissemination, or copying of this communication is strictly prohibited. If this message contains non-public personal information about any consumer or customer of the sender or intended recipient, you are further prohibited under penalty of law from using or disclosing the information to any third party by provisions of the federal Gramm-Leach-Bliley Act. If you have received this electronic message in error, please immediately notify us by return email destroy the original message to assure that it is not read, copied, or distributed by others.\r\n\r\nFrom: JP P <jabelp@gmail.com<mailto:jabelp@gmail.com>>\r\nSent: Thursday, May 21, 2026 5:09 PM\r\nTo: John Gruszecki <JGruszecki@firsthome.com<mailto:JGruszecki@firsthome.com>>; First Home VOE <VOE@firsthome.com<mailto:VOE@firsthome.com>>\r\nCc: Alex Jaffe <AJaffe@firsthome.com<mailto:AJaffe@firsthome.com>>; Zach Fahey <ZFahey@firsthome.com<mailto:ZFahey@firsthome.com>>; Chris Loughlin <CLoughlin@firsthome.com<mailto:CLoughlin@firsthome.com>>\r\nSubject: Fwd: FW: Verification of Employment Request Jabel Prom [1081510476-10]\r\n\r\n\r\n*** This message originated outside the organization ***\r\n\r\n________________________________\r\nGood afternoon,\r\nBelow is the email thread between HR and me. There you will see proof that the site was down and HR confirming this via email.\r\nAlso, my HR POC is Tiffany. Her contact details can also be found in the thread.\r\nAttached is my most recent paystub.\r\nLet me know idf you need anything else.\r\n\r\n---------- Forwarded message ---------\r\nFrom: Prom, Jabel <Jabel.Prom@ssp.navy.mil<mailto:Jabel.Prom@ssp.navy.mil>>\r\nDate: Thu, May 21, 2026 at 4:34?PM\r\nSubject: FW: Verification of Employment Request Jabel Prom [1081510476-10]\r\nTo: jabelp@gmail.com<mailto:jabelp@gmail.com> <jabelp@gmail.com<mailto:jabelp@gmail.com>>\r\n\r\n\r\nUNCLASSIFIED\r\n\r\n\r\nJabel Prom, SP27329\r\nMissile System Engineering, Integration  and Test\r\nSPALTs / Waivers & Deviations / Coordination\r\nDesk: 202-451-3935\r\nCell: 202-253-0757\r\n\r\nUNCLASSIFIED\r\n\r\nFrom: Camire, Tiffany <Tiffany.Camire@ssp.navy.mil<mailto:Tiffany.Camire@ssp.navy.mil>>\r\nSent: Thursday, May 21, 2026 11:59 AM\r\nTo: Prom, Jabel <Jabel.Prom@ssp.navy.mil<mailto:Jabel.Prom@ssp.navy.mil>>\r\nSubject: RE: Verification of Employment Request Jabel Prom [1081510476-10]\r\n\r\nGood Day,\r\n\r\nUnfortunately DCPDS is down for system updates. Please see dates below the system will be unavailable:\r\n\r\n  *   May 21, 2026 - May 25, 2026\r\n  *   June 4, 2026 - June 7, 2026\r\n  *   June 19, 2026 - June 21, 2026\r\n  *   June 25, 2026 - June 28, 2026\r\n  *   July 2, 2026 - July 6, 2026\r\n\r\nV/r\r\n\r\nTiffany Camire\r\nHuman Resource Specialist\r\nStrategic Systems Programs\r\n1250 10th Street, S.E.\r\nWashington, DC 20374\r\n\r\n\r\nFrom: Prom, Jabel <Jabel.Prom@ssp.navy.mil<mailto:Jabel.Prom@ssp.navy.mil>>\r\nSent: Thursday, May 21, 2026 11:10 AM\r\nTo: Camire, Tiffany <Tiffany.Camire@ssp.navy.mil<mailto:Tiffany.Camire@ssp.navy.mil>>\r\nSubject: RE: Verification of Employment Request Jabel Prom [1081510476-10]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nUNCLASSIFIED\r\nGood morning Tiffany,\r\nI need to verify my employment…again. However, this time I’m not able to access mybiz ( see screenshot below). Do I need to reregister for MyBiz/HR?\r\n\r\n[cid:image015.png@01DCE9FE.16A35480]\r\n\r\nJabel Prom, SP27329\r\nMissile System Engineering, Integration  and Test\r\nSPALTs / Waivers & Deviations / Coordination\r\nDesk: 202-451-3935\r\nCell: 202-253-0757\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nUNCLASSIFIED\r\n\r\nFrom: Camire, Tiffany <Tiffany.Camire@ssp.navy.mil<mailto:Tiffany.Camire@ssp.navy.mil>>\r\nSent: Friday, May 1, 2026 1:44 PM\r\nTo: Prom, Jabel <Jabel.Prom@ssp.navy.mil<mailto:Jabel.Prom@ssp.navy.mil>>\r\nSubject: FW: Verification of Employment Request Jabel Prom [1081510476-10]\r\n\r\nPer our discussion, please see below communication.\r\n\r\nV/r\r\n\r\nTiffany Camire\r\nHuman Resource Specialist\r\nStrategic Systems Programs (SPHR217)\r\n1250 10th Street, S.E. Bldg 200\r\nWashington, DC 20374\r\nOffice: (202) 451-3647\r\nCell: (202) 253-4626\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFrom: Camire, Tiffany\r\nSent: Friday, May 1, 2026 8:59 AM\r\nTo: 'First Home VOE' <VOE@firsthome.com<mailto:VOE@firsthome.com>>\r\nSubject: RE: Verification of Employment Request Jabel Prom [1081510476-10]\r\n\r\nGood Day,\r\n\r\nThank you for your patience as I was offsite with limited e-mail access this week. The employee has been advised to use MyBiz, this system will email the employment verification data. Attached is an info sheet on the system for reference.\r\n\r\nOf note- This is the standard system used for these requests. HR is typically unable to provide information on items 11, 14, 16, 17 as our pay band system operates on contribution/ performance; it is not standardized.\r\n\r\nV/r\r\n\r\nTiffany Camire\r\nHuman Resource Specialist\r\nStrategic Systems Programs\r\n1250 10th Street, S.E.\r\nWashington, DC 20374\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFrom: First Home VOE <VOE@firsthome.com<mailto:VOE@firsthome.com>>\r\nSent: Wednesday, April 29, 2026 2:38 PM\r\nTo: Camire, Tiffany <Tiffany.Camire@ssp.navy.mil<mailto:Tiffany.Camire@ssp.navy.mil>>\r\nSubject: [Non-DoD Source] Verification of Employment Request Jabel Prom [1081510476-10]\r\n\r\n\r\nGood afternoon,\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nI wanted to verify that you received the request forms. If I could please get a turnaround time for when to expect this back as well.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSamantha Roberts\r\n\r\nFirst Home Mortgage Verification Team\r\n\r\nvoe@firsthome.com<mailto:voe@firsthome.com>\r\n\r\nPhone: 443-461-1254\r\n\r\nFax: 443-725-0492\r\n\r\n6211 Greenleigh Avenue, Suite 300, Baltimore MD 21220\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n---------Original Message----------------------\r\n\r\nFrom: voe@firsthome.com<mailto:voe@firsthome.com>\r\n\r\nSent: Mon, April 27, 2026 03:26 PM\r\n\r\nTo: Tiffany.Camire@ssp.navy.mil<mailto:Tiffany.Camire@ssp.navy.mil>\r\n\r\nCc:\r\n\r\nSubject: Verification of Employment Request Jabel Prom [1081510476-10]\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Home Mortgage is requesting a written verification of employment for Jabel Prom.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n**Please note: We cannot accept electronic signatures. This must be sent back with a handwritten signature or certificate ID through Adobe on the form. If you are unable to do so please let me know and I will send a DocuSign. Or, please state you are unable to provide a handwritten signature at this time.**\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThe following documents are attached as standard procedure for written verification of employment:\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n*Instructions for completing the VOE\r\n\r\n*Borrower's Authorization Form\r\n\r\n*Written Verification of Employment Form\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease complete the Written Verification of Employment Form and return it promptly either via fax or e-mail by replying to this message.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nSamantha Roberts\r\n\r\nFirst Home Mortgage Verification Team\r\n\r\nvoe@firsthome.com<mailto:voe@firsthome.com>\r\n\r\nPhone: 443-461-1254\r\n\r\nFax: 443-725-0492\r\n\r\n6211 Greenleigh Avenue, Suite 300, Baltimore MD 21220\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCONFIDENTIALITY NOTICE\r\n\r\nThe information contained in this electronic message is confidential information intended for the use of the individual or entity named above. If the reader of this message is not the intended recipient, or an employee or agent responsible for delivering this electronic message to the intended recipient, you are hereby notified that any dissemination, or copying of this communication is strictly prohibited. If this message contains non-public personal information about any consumer or customer of the sender or intended recipient, you are further prohibited under penalty of law from using or disclosing the information to any third party by provisions of the federal Gramm-Leach-Bliley Act. If you have received this electronic message in error, please immediately notify us by return email destroy the original message to assure that it is not read, copied, or distributed by others.\r\n","IsBodyHTML":false,"CustomSendHeaders":{"X-Message-ID":"<2b67d82e-0387-4535-bb02-e4724b493d77@HQExc4V.firsthomemtg.com>"},"IsReadReceiptRequested":false,"ToRecipients":[{"__type":"FHMC.Graph.Email+MailRecipient, FHMC.Graph","EmailAddress":"MSwinehart@firsthome.com"},{"__type":"FHMC.Graph.Email+MailRecipient, FHMC.Graph","EmailAddress":"AJaffe@firsthome.com"},{"__type":"FHMC.Graph.Email+MailRecipient, FHMC.Graph","EmailAddress":"ZFahey@firsthome.com"},{"__type":"FHMC.Graph.Email+MailRecipient, FHMC.Graph","EmailAddress":"JGruszecki@firsthome.com"},{"__type":"FHMC.Graph.Email+MailRecipient, FHMC.Graph","EmailAddress":"BRauschenberg@firsthome.com"},{"__type":"FHMC.Graph.Email+MailRecipient, FHMC.Graph","EmailAddress":"MO'May@firsthome.com"}],"CcRecipients":[],"BccRecipients":[],"ReplyToList":[]} 
