As a Verification Specialist at First Home Mortgage Corporation, I am working with your Loan Officer, Natalie Marie Miller, to obtain your Current employment information.


Silverado Senior Living Managment uses an online verification company called Thomas & Company. In an effort to safeguard your privacy, Thomas & Company requires you to set up a Verifier PIN with them and then provide that pin to me. Please call T&C at 615-242-8246 or to set up your temporary pin. Once received, please email or call me with the pin and I will obtain the verification.


There are two possible types of employment verification: Employment only (Verbal) or Employment and Income (Written).


**Your loan will require a Written Verification**


Thank you for your attention to this matter. Please feel free to call me if you have any questions.


Sincerely,


Yasmim Phipps

